+is measurable from \(\bigvee_{s<t}\mathcal F_s\) into the predictable
+sigma-algebra.  The composition is precisely \(\omega\mapsto X_t(\omega)\),
+so \(X_t\) is strongly measurable with respect to the past sigma-algebra.
